# Replace NEWORG with your org and create a team named "security-owners" first
# (2 vetted owners). With the ruleset "Require review from Code Owners", changes to
# these paths cannot merge without their approval. This is what stops an attacker
# from editing the malware guard itself.
/.github/                @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
/.vscode/                @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.code-workspace         @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.config.js              @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.config.mjs             @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.config.cjs             @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.config.ts              @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
.eslintrc.js             @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
package.json             @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
package-lock.json        @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
pnpm-lock.yaml           @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
yarn.lock                @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
pyproject.toml           @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
uv.lock                  @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
Dockerfile               @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.sh                     @Imena-DevTeam/security-team
*.ps1                    @Imena-DevTeam/security-team